1. Scalable Web App with ALB and Auto Scaling

Execution Steps
1.Launch 2 EC2 instances
2.Install web server on both instances
3.Create an Application Load Balancer
4.Configure target group and attach EC2 instances
5.Create Auto Scaling Group
6.Test application using ALB DNS

Project Overview
A scalable web application deployed on AWS using EC2 instances behind an Application Load Balancer with Auto Scaling.

AWS Services Used
Amazon EC2
Application Load Balancer (ALB)
Auto Scaling Group
Security Groups

Features
Automatic traffic distribution
High availability
Auto scaling during high traffic

Architecture
User → ALB → EC2 Instances → Auto Scaling
